## What to deliver

Build the fortress up operation by operation until the model in `model.png` matches
the brief — a huge armored hull riding raised on six thick jointed
legs, a big main turret with a long forward cannon, a side turret out on each
sponson, and a sensor vane above, cleanly symmetric about its centerplane and built
as one continuous rounded surface. When you are satisfied, stop: the recorded
operations are your finished submission.
